{"id":"35681d457f526cf1","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-dialectica-modus-ponens.md","title":"Dialectica见证的局部MP组合","display":"lem-dialectica-modus-ponens — Dialectica见证的局部MP组合","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-dialectica-modus-ponens","aliases":["72-lem-dialectica-modus-ponens"],"display":"lem-dialectica-modus-ponens — Dialectica见证的局部MP组合","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; Chapter V by Jeremy Avigad and Solomon Feferman","source_location":"V §2.4 print348/PDF360, modus ponens verification following Theorem2.4.1; §3.3 print356/PDF368, modularity","verification_status":"source-proof-checked; proved-in-note","proof_status":"source MP argument checked with tuple types and simultaneous substitution; not machine verified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-dialectica-modus-ponens"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-dialectica-modus-ponens</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-dialectica-modus-ponens — Dialectica见证的局部MP组合"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; Chapter V by Jeremy Avigad and Solomon Feferman"},{"key":"source_location","html":"V §2.4 print348/PDF360, modus ponens verification following Theorem2.4.1; §3.3 print356/PDF368, modularity"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-proof-checked; proved-in-note"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source MP argument checked with tuple types and simultaneous substitution; not machine verified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0,\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c\">\\(T_0,\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega\\)</span> 是闭句；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,c,\\operatorname{Fun},A_D,B_D\">\\(w,c,\\operatorname{Fun},A_D,B_D\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a>，元组应用逐分量curried。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\rho\">\\(\\vec\\rho\\)</span> 为有限类型表；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T^c_{\\vec\\rho}\">\\(\\mathcal T^c_{\\vec\\rho}\\)</span> 由下式定义，空乘积取仅含空元组的集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a\\in\\mathcal T^c_{w(A)}\">\\(\\vec a\\in\\mathcal T^c_{w(A)}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec U\\in\\mathcal T^c_{\\operatorname{Fun}(w(A),w(B))}\">\\(\\vec U\\in\\mathcal T^c_{\\operatorname{Fun}(w(A),w(B))}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec Y\\in\\mathcal T^c_{\\operatorname{Fun}(w(A)^\\frown c(B),c(A))}\">\\(\\vec Y\\in\\mathcal T^c_{\\operatorname{Fun}(w(A)^\\frown c(B),c(A))}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y,\\vec x,\\vec v\">\\(\\vec y,\\vec x,\\vec v\\)</span> 是类型表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(A),w(A),c(B)\">\\(c(A),w(A),c(B)\\)</span> 的互异新鲜变量表；所有显示代入同时且避免捕获。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T^c_{\\vec\\rho}:=\\prod_{i&lt;|\\vec\\rho|}\\mathcal T^c_{\\rho_i}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T^c_{\\vec\\rho}:=\\prod_{i&lt;|\\vec\\rho|}\\mathcal T^c_{\\rho_i}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigl(T_0\\vdash A_D(\\vec a;\\vec y)\\bigr)\\ \\land\\\n\\bigl(T_0\\vdash A_D(\\vec x;\\vec Y\\vec x\\vec v)\\to B_D(\\vec U\\vec x;\\vec v)\\bigr)\n\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\bigl(T_0\\vdash B_D(\\vec U\\vec a;\\vec v)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigl(T_0\\vdash A_D(\\vec a;\\vec y)\\bigr)\\ \\land\\\n\\bigl(T_0\\vdash A_D(\\vec x;\\vec Y\\vec x\\vec v)\\to B_D(\\vec U\\vec x;\\vec v)\\bigr)\n\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\bigl(T_0\\vdash B_D(\\vec U\\vec a;\\vec v)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把第一前提中的挑战表代为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec Y\\vec a\\vec v\">\\(\\vec Y\\vec a\\vec v\\)</span>，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_D(\\vec a;\\vec Y\\vec a\\vec v)\">\\(A_D(\\vec a;\\vec Y\\vec a\\vec v)\\)</span>；把第二前提中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 代为封闭 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a\">\\(\\vec a\\)</span>，再在T0中用MP，得到结论。类型恰由Fun确定，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec U\\vec a\">\\(\\vec U\\vec a\\)</span> 的类型表是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w(B)\">\\(w(B)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec Y\">\\(\\vec Y\\)</span> 保留前件见证与后件挑战两个输入。空见证或空挑战表时，同一证明使用空同时代入仍成立。这是源书实际给出的局部组合证明，不依赖整个功能解释定理的未复核完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_0,\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c$ 使用 [[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]。$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega$ 是闭句；$w,c,\\operatorname{Fun},A_D,B_D$ 使用 [[72-df-dialectica-translation]]，元组应用逐分量curried。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_0,\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c$ 使用 [[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]。$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega$ 是闭句；$w,c,\\operatorname{Fun},A_D,B_D$ 使用 [[72-df-dialectica-translation]]，元组应用逐分量curried。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T_0,\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"w,c,\\operatorname{Fun},A_D,B_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T^c_{\\vec\\rho}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a\\in\\mathcal T^c_{w(A)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec U\\in\\mathcal T^c_{\\operatorname{Fun}(w(A),w(B))}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec Y\\in\\mathcal T^c_{\\operatorname{Fun}(w(A)^\\frown c(B),c(A))}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec y,\\vec x,\\vec v","display":false},{"tex":"c(A),w(A),c(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T^c_{\\vec\\rho}:=\\prod_{i<|